The '''Night Squid''' was a {{Common}} variant of the [[Squid]] found only at night while using {{Item|Dark Bait}} or fishing in {{Zone|The Park}} during rain. It required {{Skill|Fishing|3}} to fish up.

== Spawning ==
A '''Night Squid''' could be fished up from any source of [[Water]] during {{Aqua|Nighttime}} while using {{Item|Dark Bait}} if the player had {{Skl|Fishing|III}} or higher. 

However, while the rain bought from {{NPCSprite|Vanessa}} is active in {{Zone|The Park}}, the catching chance for the '''Night Squid''' would become a set value, making the chance for a player's sea creature catch to be a '''Night Squid''' {{Green|22.2%}}. Importantly, during rain, '''Night Squid''' can still be rolled normally if the necessary conditions are met ({{Aqua|Nighttime}}, {{Item|Dark Bait}} and {{Skl|Fishing|3}} or higher). 

