== Tips ==
*The Night Squid was the best [[Sea Creature]] to farm {{Item|Ink Sac}}s from as it dropped more {{Item|Ink Sac}}s than any other Sea Creature.
*The maximum possible '''Night Squid''' rate was {{Green|31.10%}}; obtainable with rain from {{NPCSprite|Vanessa}}, {{Item|Common Hook}}, and {{Item|Squid Hat}} during {{Aqua|Nighttime}} with [[Dark Bait]]. 

